# Service Cleanup - 2026-03-11

## Problem:
Two systemd services were running simultaneously:
- crypto-bot.service (disabled)
- crypto-signal-bot.service (enabled)

This caused duplicate bot processes.

## Solution:
- Stopped and disabled crypto-bot.service
- Kept only crypto-signal-bot.service (enabled)

## Result:
✅ Single process running
✅ No duplicate signals
✅ Auto-restart working correctly
